    "what": "Reward-head facts read off five real reward-model checkpoints on the HuggingFace hub.",
    "how": "huggingface_hub.HfApi().get_safetensors_metadata(repo_id), which range-reads each shard's safetensors header, plus that repo's config.json. No weights were downloaded. Tensor entries under model.layers.* are dropped; what is kept is every non-block tensor, which is where a reward head, a gate and an embedding live.",
